{"availability":"available","full":"JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit","name":"agent-service-toolkit","description":"Full toolkit for running an AI agent service built with LangGraph, FastAPI and Streamlit","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":4531,"forks":794,"created":"2024-08-04T23:13:44Z","updated":"2026-10-18T14:34:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agent-service-toolkit.streamlit.app","topics":["agents","langgraph","streamlit"],"demo":"https://agent-service-toolkit.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T16:52:27.992Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T16:52:27.992Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T16:52:27.992Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:39.983Z","stars":4512,"forks":790},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:22:28.187Z","stars":4516,"forks":788},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:28:23.290Z","stars":4516,"forks":790},{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:18.754Z","stars":4517,"forks":791},{"at":"2026-10-18T16:52:27.992Z","stars":4531,"forks":794}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A full toolkit for running an AI agent service built with LangGraph, FastAPI and Streamlit.","It includes a LangGraph agent, a FastAPI service to serve it, a client to interact with the service, and a Streamlit app that uses the client to provide a chat interface. Data structures and settings are built with Pydantic.","This project offers a template for you to easily build and run your own agents using the LangGraph framework. It demonstrates a complete setup from agent definition to user interface, making it easier to get started with LangGraph-based projects by providing a full, robust toolkit."],"features":["LangGraph Agent and latest features: A customizable agent built using the LangGraph framework. Implements the latest LangGraph v1.0 features including human in the loop with interrupt(), flow control with Command,…","FastAPI Service: Serves the agent with both streaming and non-streaming endpoints.","Advanced Streaming: A novel approach to support both token-based and message-based streaming.","Streamlit Interface: Provides a user-friendly chat interface for interacting with the agent, including voice input and output.","Multiple Agent Support: Run multiple agents in the service and call by URL path. Available agents and models are described in /info"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8be8bcdd5f9cc83fd0fc39740ca88eac6888d501ebf597bac36cc10b937cd5ab","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:40.069Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:18.872Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A full toolkit for running an AI agent service built with LangGraph, FastAPI and Streamlit.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Content Moderation: Implements Safeguard for content moderation (requires Groq API key).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"At least one LLM API key or configuration is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8be8bcdd5f9cc83fd0fc39740ca88eac6888d501ebf597bac36cc10b937cd5ab","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:18.872Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T16:49:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JoshuaC215/agent-service-toolkit/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:18.873Z","hash":"8be8bcdd5f9cc83fd0fc39740ca88eac6888d501ebf597bac36cc10b937cd5ab","originalBytes":13811,"storedBytes":13811,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:18.754Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:14.272Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-1